  "implications_for_w6": [
    "Startup attachment cannot be disabled in Fortress 6.16 => the sample would be welded to the left gripper from t=0, which is NOT a GRASP.",
    "Startup attachment is racy and can teleport the child by 0.475 m, violating the frozen 2 mm attach criterion (C4.3_S4_执行规划.md 14.3 C3) if ever relied on.",
    "Topic-triggered attach/detach is deterministic and does not snap => GRASP must be the first attach, with the startup weld removed (detach at startup) or replaced by a custom system plugin. Both need approval before W6 product code."
